{"title": "Dauntless", "pageid": 20570, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dauntless", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Dauntless</b> is a passive feature that prevents you from being Frightened.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You can't be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frightened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Frightened_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\">Frightened</a> or afflicted with other emotion-altering conditions. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cloth_of_Authority\" title=\"Cloth of Authority\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Cloth_of_Authority_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Cloth_of_Authority_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Cloth_of_Authority_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Cloth_of_Authority_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0a/Cloth_of_Authority_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Cloth_of_Authority_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0a/Cloth_of_Authority_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Cloth_of_Authority_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0a/Cloth_of_Authority_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Cloth_of_Authority\" title=\"Cloth of Authority\">Cloth of Authority</a></span></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dauntless_Amulet\" title=\"Dauntless Amulet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Amulet_Necklace_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Amulet_Necklace_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5e/Amulet_Necklace_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Amulet_Necklace_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Amulet_Necklace_D_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Dauntless_Amulet\" title=\"Dauntless Amulet\">Dauntless Amulet</a></span>&nbsp;<i>(inaccessible)</i></li><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet\" title=\"Sarevok's Horned Helmet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok%27s_Horned_Helmet\" title=\"Sarevok's Horned Helmet\">Sarevok's Horned Helmet</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Enver_Gortash\" title=\"Enver Gortash\">Enver Gortash</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Dauntless prevents any condition in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Frightened\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(status_group)\" title=\"Frightened (status group)\">Frightened</a></span> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/30px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/40px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fleeing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp/20px-Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Condition_Type_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fleeing_(status_group)\" title=\"Fleeing (status group)\">Fleeing</a></span> status groups, as well as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hideous_Laughter_(Condition)\" title=\"Hideous Laughter (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hideous Laughter\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hideous_Laughter_(Condition)\" title=\"Hideous Laughter (Condition)\">Hideous Laughter</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Cannot be <a href=\"/wiki/Frightened_(Condition)\" title=\"Frightened (Condition)\">Frightened</a> or afflicted with other emotion-altering conditions.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202327\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.067 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.075 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2526/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26619/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7472/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 142/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 968817/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   66.950      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   66.950      1 -total\n 35.36%   23.673      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 30.86%   20.662      3 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 29.05%   19.450      3 Template:MdRarityItem\n 26.42%   17.685      2 Template:Cond\n 24.49%   16.396      3 Template:Item_icon\n 21.20%   14.197     26 Template:Trim\n 19.84%   13.284      4 Template:Icon_text\n 16.25%   10.880     10 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:20570-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202327 and revision id 390116. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}